{"id":"aire","lemma":"aire","pos":"noun","rank":506,"glosses":["air (the substance constituting earth's atmosphere)","air (the open space above the ground)","air; wind"],"ipa":"/ˈaiɾe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"aires"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-aire.wav","formAudio":{"aires":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Akhram-aires.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Necesitamos aire fresco.","en":"We need fresh air.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/68684","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},null,{"g":"fresh"}]},{"text":"Vivir sin aire es imposible.","en":"To live without air is impossible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735463","words":[{"g":"to live"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"impossible"}]},{"text":"Un cambio de aires te hará mucho bien.","en":"A change of air will do you a lot of good.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/607957","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"change, shift"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"well"}]},{"text":"Necesito algo de aire.","en":"I need to get some air.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460568","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"something, anything"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Sin aire estamos muertos.","en":"We would die without air.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587491","words":[{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"dead","l":"muerto"}]}]}